    {
      "id": "claim_6384dfa2c6c9455f932d8925fdcfa0c9",
      "statement": "CacheManager composes LocalCache file names as <Origin>_<parameters>.json, sanitizing colons to __ and forward/backward slashes to -- so the file lands directly in the cache directory (verified by CacheManagerTest's CacheManagerTest_openai--gpt-4o-mini_1.json assertion); ChatCacheParameter.parameters() joins model name and seed and omits temperature when it is 0.0 for backward compatibility with LiSSA's existing caches; and buildCacheHierarchy hands every layer of one hierarchy the same cache-file path plus one shared ObjectMapper — Redis-based layers ignore the file path, while LocalCache ignores the mapper and serializes with its own static Jackson mapper.",
